sted on a recognised stock exchange?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If no, go to question 22.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If yes, go to question 24.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>22. If the shares were not listed on a recognised stock exchange, was a valuation agreed with HMRC?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p><text:p></text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce30' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>23. If yes, enter the HMRC valuation reference given.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce17' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>24. Number of securities acquired.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter the number to 2 decimal places. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>For example, 100.00</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce30' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>25. Security type. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Follow the link at cell A3 for a list of security types. Enter a number from 1 to 3.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If restricted enter 1 and go to question 26.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If unrestricted enter 2 and go to question 29. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If convertible enter 3 and go to question 32. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If both restricted and convertible, enter 1 and answer all questions from 26 to 40.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p></text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce30' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>26. If restricted, nature of restriction. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter a number from 1 to 3.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Follow the link at cell A3 for a list of restrictions.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce52' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>27. If restricted, length of time of restriction in years.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter the time in years.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If the time is less than a whole year, enter as a decimal fraction to 1 decimal place, for example 0.6.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce13' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>28. If restricted, actual market value per security at date of acquisition.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter the value in pounds to 4 decimal places. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>For example, 10.1234</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>No entry should be made if an election to disregard all restrictions is operated.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce13' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>29. Unrestricted market value per security at date of acquisition.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter the value in pounds to 4 decimal places. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>For example, 10.1234</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>30. If restricted, has an election been operated to disregard restrictions?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p></text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>31. If an election has been operated to disregard restrictions, have all or some been disregarded?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter all or some.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce13' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>32. If convertible, market value per security ignoring conversion rights.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter the value in pounds to 4 decimal places. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>For example, 10.1234</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce13' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>33. Total price paid for the securities.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter the value in pounds to 4 decimal places. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>For example, 10.1234</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>34. Was the price paid in pounds sterling?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>35. Was there an artificial reduction in value on acquisition?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If yes go to question 36.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>If no go to question 37.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce30' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>36. If there was an artificial reduction in value, nature of the artificial reduction.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter a number from 1 to 3. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Follow the link in cell A3 for a list of types of artificial restriction.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>37. Were shares acquired under an employee shareholder arrangement?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p></text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>38. If shares were acquired under an employee shareholder arrangement, was the total actual market value (AMV) of shares £2,000 or more?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>39. Was PAYE operated?</text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name='ce28' calcext:value-type='string'><text:p>40. Was any adjustment made for amounts subject to apportionment for residence or duties outside the UK. </text:p><text:p></text:p><text:p>Enter yes or no.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table